# Patterns are relative to the build context root (the workspace folder that
# holds the service checkout as `backoffice/`), not to this repository. BuildKit
# reads this file because it is named after Dockerfile.
**/.git
**/.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/e2e
**/docs
